---
layout: base.njk
title: Blog — Abantika
---
{% set articles = blog | published %}
<div class="page-shell">
  {% include "components/header.njk" %}
  <main class="inner-page blog-page">
    <section class="page-intro compact">
      <p class="eyebrow">05 / BLOG</p>
      <h1>NOTES ON<br>METHOD AND<br>MEANING<span class="red-stop">.</span></h1>
      <p>Longer essays on analytical work. Articles are Markdown-driven. Findings stay unpublished until verified source material is supplied.</p>
    </section>
    {% if articles.length %}
    <section class="blog-index" aria-label="Articles">
      {% for article in articles %}
      <a class="blog-row" href="{{ article.url }}">
        <span>{{ article.dateISO }}</span>
        <h2>{{ article.title | editorialBreak | safe }}</h2>
        <p>{{ article.category | upper }}</p>
        <b aria-hidden="true">→</b>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </section>
    {% else %}
    <section class="journal-empty">
      <div><span>NO</span><span>LIVE</span><span>COPY</span></div>
      <article>
        <p class="eyebrow">ARTICLES / PENDING</p>
        <h2>THE LONG<br>FORM<span class="red-stop">.</span></h2>
        <p>[PLACEHOLDER — Published essays will appear here.]</p>
      </article>
      <aside>METHOD<br>EVIDENCE<br>LIMITS</aside>
    </section>
    {% endif %}
  </main>
  {% include "components/footer.njk" %}
</div>
